13	 *   - Scheduled restarts: CRUD over GameSchedule; the worker sweep fires them.
14	 *
15	 * Every value that reaches a shell/RCON is validated in lib/game-control.ts
16	 * (ports, paths, player ids, command lines). Root/RCON credentials never leave the
17	 * server and are never surfaced in an error. SANDBOX: inline reads return realistic
18	 * synthetic data; mutating jobs settle without touching a VM.
